  "details": "Output log: https://www.dropbox.com/s/ph9kyb3bw7yp7r6/output_log_7-59-24_AM.txt?dl=0\n\nWhen loading vrchat during a network disruption, it's possible that the initial connect to your home world fails; when this happens, vrchat will fall back to joining a public instance of that same world. The above log shows this happening (several other people had the same thing happen to them and joined the same public instance).",
